# 기후동행카드 조회 시스템 환경변수 설정
# 사용법: cp .env.example .env 후 실제 값으로 수정

# ============================================================================
# 환경 선택
# ============================================================================
# COMPOSE_PROFILES: dev, prod, neon 중 하나 선택
# - dev: 로컬 개발 (PostgreSQL + Redis만 Docker)
# - prod: 프로덕션 배포 (전체 스택 Docker)
# - neon: Neon DB 사용 (PostgreSQL 제외한 전체 스택)
COMPOSE_PROFILES=dev

# ============================================================================
# Database 설정
# ============================================================================
# dev/prod 환경: 로컬 PostgreSQL
DB_NAME=climate_transport
DB_USERNAME=postgres
DB_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME
DB_HOST=localhost
DB_PORT=5432

# neon 환경: Neon PostgreSQL (DATABASE_URL만 설정)
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@ep-xxx-xxx.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require

# ============================================================================
# Redis 설정
# ============================================================================
REDIS_HOST=localhost
REDIS_PORT=6379
REDIS_MAX_MEMORY=256mb
REDIS_MEMORY_LIMIT=256M

# ============================================================================
# PostgreSQL 설정 (dev/prod 환경)
# ============================================================================
# dev: 개발 환경 설정
# POSTGRES_SHARED_BUFFERS=128MB
# POSTGRES_MAX_CONNECTIONS=100
# POSTGRES_WORK_MEM=4MB
# POSTGRES_MEMORY_LIMIT=512M

# prod: 프로덕션 환경 (1GB RAM 최적화)
# POSTGRES_SHARED_BUFFERS=128MB
# POSTGRES_MAX_CONNECTIONS=50
# POSTGRES_WORK_MEM=4MB
# POSTGRES_MEMORY_LIMIT=256M

# ============================================================================
# Backend 설정 (prod/neon 환경)
# ============================================================================
BACKEND_PORT=8080
BACKEND_MEMORY_LIMIT=512M
SPRING_PROFILE=dev

# ============================================================================
# API Keys
# ============================================================================
# Public Data API (공공데이터포털 - ws.bus.go.kr)
PUBLIC_API_SERVICE_KEY=your_public_api_service_key_here

# Seoul Open Data API (서울열린데이터광장 - data.seoul.go.kr)
SEOUL_API_KEY=your_seoul_api_key_here

# Admin API Key (관리자 API 인증키 - 절대 공유 금지!)
# 생성 방법: openssl rand -base64 32
ADMIN_API_KEY=your_admin_api_key_here

# ============================================================================
# Monitoring (선택사항)
# ============================================================================
# Sentry DSN (에러 트래킹)
SENTRY_DSN=
SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN=

# ============================================================================
# 환경별 설정 가이드
# ============================================================================

# 📌 로컬 개발 환경 (dev)
# -----------------------
# COMPOSE_PROFILES=dev
# DB_PASSWORD=1q2w
# REDIS_MAX_MEMORY=256mb
# SPRING_PROFILE=dev
# PUBLIC_API_SERVICE_KEY=실제_키_입력
# SEOUL_API_KEY=실제_키_입력
# ADMIN_API_KEY=개발용_키_입력

# 📌 프로덕션 환경 (prod)
# -----------------------
# COMPOSE_PROFILES=prod
# DB_PASSWORD=강력한_비밀번호
# REDIS_MAX_MEMORY=100mb
# POSTGRES_MEMORY_LIMIT=256M
# BACKEND_MEMORY_LIMIT=512M
# SPRING_PROFILE=prod
# PUBLIC_API_SERVICE_KEY=실제_키_입력
# SEOUL_API_KEY=실제_키_입력
# ADMIN_API_KEY=보안_강화된_키
# SENTRY_DSN=실제_DSN_입력

# 📌 Neon DB 환경 (neon)
# -----------------------
# COMPOSE_PROFILES=neon
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@ep-xxx.neon.tech/db?sslmode=require
# REDIS_MAX_MEMORY=100mb
# BACKEND_MEMORY_LIMIT=512M
# SPRING_PROFILE=prod
# PUBLIC_API_SERVICE_KEY=실제_키_입력
# SEOUL_API_KEY=실제_키_입력
# ADMIN_API_KEY=보안_강화된_키
# SENTRY_DSN=실제_DSN_입력
